{"5030680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voidpath", "steam_appid": 5030680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5036860], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the Void</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voidpath</strong> is a top-down twin-stick space combat roguelike. Rewrite your loadout with weapons, abilities, and  items, then push a <strong>relay chart</strong> through four sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a different chart: combat rooms, elites, shops, events, and hunters await. Between sectors, <strong>relays</strong> reshape the next floor. Opt into <strong>Directives</strong> for harder rules that unlock more content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What awaits.....</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; abilities</strong>  primaries, secondaries, and signature abilities that define your tempo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items &amp; synergies</strong> forty-plus stackable items with tags, procs, and build-defining links.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigils &amp; relays</strong>  hangar blessings that last until the next boss, plus between-sector modules that rewrite the chart ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses &amp; hunters</strong>  sector bosses from the Harvester to Omega Signal, unlockable hunters on the relay chart, and a final stand against the Singularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directives</strong>  an opt-in difficulty ladder. Take the risk; earn the unlocks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless</strong>  How long can you hold the signal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong>  competitive PvP combat </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play;</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online (&amp; Local) PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the Void</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voidpath</strong> is a top-down twin-stick space combat roguelike. Rewrite your loadout with weapons, abilities, and  items, then push a <strong>relay chart</strong> through four sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a different chart: combat rooms, elites, shops, events, and hunters await. Between sectors, <strong>relays</strong> reshape the next floor. Opt into <strong>Directives</strong> for harder rules that unlock more content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What awaits.....</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; abilities</strong>  primaries, secondaries, and signature abilities that define your tempo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items &amp; synergies</strong> forty-plus stackable items with tags, procs, and build-defining links.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigils &amp; relays</strong>  hangar blessings that last until the next boss, plus between-sector modules that rewrite the chart ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses &amp; hunters</strong>  sector bosses from the Harvester to Omega Signal, unlockable hunters on the relay chart, and a final stand against the Singularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directives</strong>  an opt-in difficulty ladder. Take the risk; earn the unlocks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless</strong>  How long 